[LineName "01. The final picture (2/8)"]
[LineDescription "The ladder's last rung: one rook on the 7th rank, the other checks on the 8th."]

{[%csl Bd8,Bb8] Mate in 1 again: the wall on the 7th rank, the check on the
8th.} 1. Ra8# {[%csl Rc8] Checkmate! The rook on a8 checks along the 8th rank
and the rook on e7 holds the 7th: the king has no square left.} *

