rows.} 1... Kd6 {[%csl Bc6,Bd6,Be6,Bf6,Bc7,Bd7,Be7,Bf7,Bc8,Bd8,Be8,Bf8]} 2. Rb6+
{Check on the 6th rank! The rook on g5 holds the 5th rank, so the king has to
climb to the 7th.} 2... Kc7 {[%csl Bc7,Bd7,Be7,Bf7,Bc8,Bd8,Be8,Bf8] The king
attacks the rook on b6!} 3. Rh6 {The king attacked the rook: it moves to the far
side, h6, out of the king's reach and still holds the 6th rank.} 3... Kb7 {[%csl
Ba7,Bb7,Bc7,Bd7,Be7,Bf7,Ba8,Bb8,Bc8,Bd8,Be8,Bf8]} 4. Rg7+ {Check on the 7th
rank: up to the 8th.} 4... Ka8 {[%csl Ba8,Bb8,Bc8,Bd8,Be8,Bf8]} 5. Rh8# {[%csl
Ra8] Checkmate! The rook on h8 checks along the 8th rank and the rook on g7
holds the 7th: the king has no square left.} *

