queen and rook.} 1. Qe5 {The queen takes the 5th rank: the wall moves up, and
the king is locked in the top 3 rows.} 1... Kd7 {[%csl Bc6,Bd7]} 2. Rb6 {The
wall moves up to the 6th rank: 2 rows left.} 2... Kc8 {[%csl Bd7,Bc8,Bd8]} 3.
Qg7 {The wall moves up to the 7th rank: 1 row left.} 3... Kd8 {[%csl
Bc8,Bd8,Be8]} 4. Rb8# {[%csl Rd8] Checkmate! The rook on b8 checks along the 8th
rank and the queen on g7 holds the 7th: the king has no square left.} *

