{[%csl Bf7,Be7,Be8] [%cal Rd2d7] Queen and rook again: careful with quiet queen
moves.} 1. Qh6+ {Not Qd7: that takes all 3 of the king's squares without check,
and it is stalemate! Check! The king has to step away; its toughest reply is
e7.} 1... Ke7 {[%csl Bd8,Be8,Bf7,Bd7]} 2. Rg7+ {Check on the 7th rank! The queen
on h6 holds the 6th rank, so the king has to climb to the 8th.} 2... Kd8 {[%csl
Be8,Bc8] [%cal Rh6e6,Rh6c6] Careful: Qe6 or Qc6 would be stalemate.} 3. Qh8#
{Checkmate! The queen on h8 checks along the 8th rank and the rook on g7 holds
the 7th: the king has no square left.} *

[Event "06. Final exam (1/8)"]
[Site "Endgame Classroom"]
