[LineName "06. Final exam (1/8)"]
[LineDescription "Wall and check, row by row: the two-rook mate."]

{Final exam! No colours and no hints this time. Usually the pieces do it alone,
but now and then the fastest mate needs your king. Find the fastest mate. Two
rooks: mate as fast as you can.} 1. Re4 Kd5 2. Rcc4 Kd6 3. Kb6 Kd7 4. Rcd4+ Kc8
5. Re8# {Checkmate! The rook on e8 checks along the 8th rank, and the rook on d4
covers the squares in front of the king.} *

